.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Hugo build output (per README §7.2 known issue)
public/
resources/
.hugo_build.lock

# Private payout config override (per docs/worldfirst-usd-checklist.md §3.2)
# Contains WorldFirst USD account 4 fields — NEVER commit.
hugo.local.toml

# GSC service account JSON key (per docs/gsc-setup-guide.md §4)
# OAuth credential — if leaked, attacker can read Search Console data.
scripts/gsc-key.json

# Mock reader feedback reports (per docs/mock-reader-personas.md)
# Default ignored so docs/feedback/ stays out of git; user can `git add -f`
# individual reports they want to archive.
docs/feedback/

# Claude Code scratch dir (e.g. mermaid-build temp rendering pipeline)
# Transient build artifacts + node_modules; never tracked. Clean up via
# `rm -rf .claude/scratch/<build-name>/` after use.
.claude/scratch/